        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Darabont, Stephen King, IronE Singleton\n- Works: The Shawshank Redemption, The Green Mile, The Mist, The Tommyknockers, T-Dog, The Walking Dead\n- Roles: director, writer, series developer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- In 1993, The Tommyknockers was released as a television miniseries based on the Stephen King novel of the same name.\n- Frank Darabont is known as a director for film adaptations of Stephen King works including The Shawshank Redemption, The Green Mile, and The Mist.\n- Frank Darabont wrote and directed the film The Mist.\n- Frank Darabont created the character T-Dog for The Walking Dead as the series developer.\n- IronE Singleton portrayed T-Dog in The Walking Dead.",
